## Human intervention needed

The automated job failed during `setup/normal_setup()` while preparing the existing `6.0.2` test suite for `org.springframework:spring-context:6.0.4`; it did not reach test generation, native-image repair, or metrics collection.

Preserved work: https://github.com/oracle/graalvm-reachability-metadata/tree/ai%2Fkimeta%2Fhuman-intervention%2Fissue-9929-fails-native-image-run-org.springframework-spring-context-6.0.4-18918875

